/T (Product certification is the process whereby a company's product is officially evaluated and recognized to meet specific standards, technical specifications, or regulations set by competent certification bodies or agencies. The steps to obtain product certification for a company may vary depending on the type of product and the required standards. Product certification serves several important functions in the context of business and consumers. The functions of product certification include enhancing consumer confidence, meeting legal and regulatory requirements, and many more.)
