/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (CV Nurul Janah is committed to sustainable responsibility by strengthening relationships, ensuring the quality and consistency of raw materials produced, and guaranteeing suppliers a fair, reasonable and competitive price agreement for mutual benefit.)
