1050 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (We actively seek to engage local suppliers to improve community welfare, selecting them based on price agreement aand availability to accept special requests. Furthermore, we work with local farmers, particularly from several villages in Sumenep district, East Java, to supply raw materials to our company. The moringa farmers we nurture are responsible for the supply of those raw materials, reflecting CV Nurul Janah's commitment to sustainability by empowering local farmers and respecting local wisdom.)
/E (We actively seek to engage local suppliers to improve community welfare, selecting them based on price agreement aand availability to accept special requests. Furthermore, we work with local farmers, particularly from several villages in Sumenep district, East Java, to supply raw materials to our company. The moringa farmers we nurture are responsible for the supply of those raw materials, reflecting CV Nurul Janah's commitment to sustainability by empowering local farmers and respecting local wisdom.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [5]
>>
